Title: MaxClipper: Install-in-One-Command Clipping Studio
Author:
  Given: MaxClipper Team
Family: MaxClipper
Version: 0.1.0
Date-released: 2026-11-21
URL: https://github.com/4hmed1/MaxClipper
Identifier: https://github.com/4hmed1/MaxClipper
Abstract: MaxClipper is an open-source, local-first application that turns YouTube links into ready-to-post vertical Shorts, Reels, and TikTok videos. It installs with one command on Windows, macOS, and Linux, runs fully on the user's own computer, and never makes them touch FFmpeg, Python paths, or config files. Everything is free, unlimited, no watermark, no account, 100% private.
Repository: https://github.com/4hmed1/MaxClipper